── SYNTAX ERROR ───────────── E0100_several_values_after_return.lt:2:15  [E0100]

Stilt returns several values as one tuple, as `return (a, b)`:

  2 │   return a / 2, b / 2
    │               ^

A tuple groups values in parentheses. A failure is raised with `raise`, not
returned beside the result.

To fix it, return a tuple:

  2 │   return (a / 2, b / 2)
    │          +            +
